      "benefits": "Proposed recovery and skin-remodeling rationale: this separate-product stack contains BPC-157, TB-500 and GHK-Cu. BPC-157 has animal wound-repair findings, while GHK-Cu has animal connective-tissue findings and limited topical cosmetic evidence. These component results explain the proposed aims; they do not establish benefits of using all three together or of the stack's injection schedule. No direct combined-efficacy study was found."
